@Api = http://localhost:5080

### Pending migrations per context (503 until the bundle has run)
GET {{Api}}/health/schema

### Products, seeded by UseSeeding/UseAsyncSeeding
GET {{Api}}/products

### Create a product (also writes to the audit context)
POST {{Api}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "EF Core Migrations Workshop",
  "sku": "EF-MIG-01",
  "price": 29.90,
  "stock": 25,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Unknown category returns 400
POST {{Api}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost",
  "price": 1,
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": 99
}

### Latest audit entries
GET {{Api}}/audit
